%% Phase1 / channel / MV3-G08a 创建群聊
%% 客户端合同真源: /System/Volumes/Data/workspace/worktrees/sync-event-alignment/cses-client/specs/003-messagev3-gate-inventory/gates/channel/mv3-g08a/contract.json
%% UI owners: src/pages/message-v3/components/dialog-search/dialog-search.component.ts；src/pages/message-v3/service/dialogSwitch.service.ts；src/pages/message-v3/service/message.service.ts::createGroupChat
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular UI
  participant Gate as MessageV3 Gate Port
  participant Native as Tauri Native
  participant FFI as Flutter FFI
  participant Web as Browser Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM Server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink raw bytes
  Note over UI,Gate: 用户目标：成员在通讯录勾选若干人建群，或点某个人发起单聊；会话列表立刻出现这个新会话并自动切入，被拉进来的人也在自己的会话列表看到它。
  Note over UI,Web: 当前覆盖状态：mock=implemented；helix=full；dual=yes；personaLocal=no；该图是交互合同，不把 Mock、HTTP 2xx 或静态注册写成真实 Green
  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: createChannel(payload)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_create_channel", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Flutter FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_create_channel", payload)
  else Browser Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_create_channel", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: ExecutionShell::step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 建群 / 发起单聊 的入参，生成 corr_key/req_id
  IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /channel/create
  Host->>Go: HTTP request with tenant/auth/corr headers
  Go-->>Host: HTTP response（2xx 只代表 admission/query response）
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(http)
  E->>IM: correlate req_id/corr_key
  Go-->>WS: WS authority event or canonical result
  WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(authority bytes)
  E->>IM: apply authoritative event before settlement
  IM->>Host: Effect::PersistAtomic(projection + cursor)
  Host->>DB: transaction channel + members + cursor
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(PersistOk)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(PersistOk)
  E->>IM: release only matching authority corr
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist ScopedGet(readback)
  Host->>DB: durable readback
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(readback)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(readback)
  E->>IM: readback is the projection source
  IM->>Sink: Effect::Emit {event,data}（channelCreated，CREATE_DIALOG）
  Sink-->>UI: Native im:__bus__ raw event → Angular projection
  Sink-->>FFI: FFI batch raw {event,data}
  Sink-->>Web: Web EventBatch raw {event,data}
  alt HTTP / PortReply / Persist error
    IM->>IM: keep prior durable state；attach structured error to corr_key
    IM-->>E: Err or correlated error result
    E-->>Gate: controlled failure
    Gate-->>UI: error / empty state；不得伪造成功事件
  end
  Note over IM,DB: 关键效果：channel.members 含创建者自己且整体去重；channel.memberCount === channel.members.length；owner 指向创建者；会话集合新增该 channel（channels.get(id) 非空），且 messages 表初始化为空数组（新频道无历史）；创建者侧 channel.unreadCount === 0 且 mentionCount === 0（新频道逐成员计数器独立初始化为 0）；被邀成员侧 channel.unreadCount === 0（各侧独立计算：接收侧的 0 必须来自自己的成员计数器初始化，禁止从创建者侧复制）
  Note over UI,Web: 关键负向：forceCreate 非 true 且已存在同人单聊时不得重复建：会话集合 size 不变，必须返回已有 channel；新频道不得带 rootId（rootId 是话题标记，createChannel 路径必须 undefined）—— 否则会被误当话题过滤出主会话列表；userIds 内 undefined / 空串必须 filter 掉再 spread（spread 前 filter undefined 雷区），否则 members 出现 userId=undefined 的幽灵成员，memberCount 与位图长度双双错位
  Note over E,Sink: 出站事件集合：channelCreated，CREATE_DIALOG；跨端只搬运 {event,data} 原始字节，不在 shell 复制 reducer
